{"corpus":"ccc","number":2627,"text_html":"<span>Deux formes fondamentales expriment ce mouvement : tantôt, elle monte, portée dans l’Esprit Saint, par le Christ<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§1083</sup> vers le Père <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> ; tantôt, elle implore la grâce de l’Esprit Saint qui, par le Christ, descend d’auprès du Père <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">2</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["1083"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Ep 1:3-14"},{"text":"2 Co 1:3-7"},{"text":"2 Co 1 P 1:3-9"},{"text":"2 Co 13:13"},{"text":"Rm 15:5-6"},{"text":"Rm 15:13"},{"text":"Ep 6:23-24"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ep 1:3-14","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"2 Co 1:3-7 .","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"1 P 1:3-9 .","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 2 Co 13:13","idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Rm 15:5-6","idx":5,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"15:13","idx":6,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"Ep 6:23-24","idx":7,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":2}]}